<title>POLAND: Dom-Plast 96 net rises to PLN 8.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Dom-Plast 96 net rises to PLN 8.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dom-Plast SA preliminary results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    15.81   vs    7.76</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			16.57   vs    5.21</p>
<p>    net profit			     8.87   vs    2.60</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Dom-Plast SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     71.27   vs   78.46</p>
<p>    costs of sales			44.03   vs   60.47</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     7.62   vs    2.61</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.09   vs    0.49</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.33   vs    3.69</p>
<p>    investment			    10.42   vs    7.87</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
